  "description": "Waking up as the villainess destined for a gruesome death, Olivia de Versace only has two goals in mind: 1. Avoid the Imperial Palace at all costs, and 2. Marry her childhood crush and live her life in peace. With a newfound passion for both swordsmanship and commerce and romance in the air, Olivia is building her reputation as the new local girlboss. But… does all of this attention come at a price? Why are all of these men she’s trying to stay far away from flocking to her side?! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
